Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos8
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos8)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos8)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos8).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos8 adds RTL8187/RTL8187B USB Wi-Fi (GitHub LCOS#81) on top of the
 lcos7 high-impact HW module set.
 .
 Default kernel on LCOS 0.7 ISOs (Devuan 6.x kernel removed from those
 images). On earlier LCOS releases that still ship a Distro kernel,
 installing this metapackage adds a GRUB entry alongside it.
